- `m-sat-dwell` rerun (18 pods): panel 6's saturation-analyzer delta and panel 4's queue-depth peak
  line up exactly in time, visually confirming the doc's own P99-TTFT-91,712ms /
  saturation-lags-demand finding rather than just restating it in numbers.

